rking in the valley’s darkest corners. A ruthless gang of banished native renegades arsonists who leave a trail of fire and ash across every path they cross.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358630/extras/b3be2721a3f473561974580ae8895573.poster.avif?t=1787693693\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358630/extras/b3be2721a3f473561974580ae8895573.webm?t=1787693693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358630/extras/b3be2721a3f473561974580ae8895573.mp4?t=1787693693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">📖 A STORY WORTH FOLLOWING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Marshal carries something he won't talk about. The Sheriff knew the truth before anyone believed her. The Native tribe's children are disappearing too. A Priest needs help uncovering the darkest secrets of a cannibalistic cult and somewhere in the wilderness, a man in a broken face is playing a very long game. The frontier has a mystery. You're in the middle of it. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358630/extras/aa19bc42ededa0ca86064c3de3af505b.poster.avif?t=1787693693\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358630/extras/aa19bc42ededa0ca86064c3de3af505b.webm?t=1787693693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358630/extras/aa19bc42ededa0ca86064c3de3af505b.mp4?t=1787693693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">PLAY TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Western Rye is built for co-op from the ground up! Up to 4 players on the same frontier. Build your homesteads side by side. Share resources. Cover each other in combat. Face the night or Sleep through it together and wake at dawn. Every mission, every bounty, every dark night is better with company. Survive alone if you have to. Thrive together if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358630/extras/159321b0d4329dc108e745e6502c8f9a.poster.avif?t=1787693693\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358630/extras/159321b0d4329dc108e745e6502c8f9a.webm?t=1787693693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358630/extras/159321b0d4329dc108e745e6502c8f9a.mp4?t=1787693693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Western Rye is an open world survival crafting adventure game set in the old west American Frontier. Create your dream outlaw! Survive the the wild west, farm, build your ranch, endure the weather, fight and forge your legend with friends or alone. In Western Rye, the wild west just got wilder!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Western Rye could be a dream game for anyone who’s wished that the Red Dead Redemption franchise dove more into survival/crafting features and inherited mechanics that wouldn’t be out of place in a game like Valheim.”<br>Screenrant<br><br>“Featuring stunning visuals, immersive gameplay, and an epic story, our Wild West post-apocalyptic game is a must-play for fans of western, action, adventure, and survival games.”<br>80 Level<br><br>“...if you’re dying for another game that puts you in the danger-filled wild West, you’re in luck, as Western Rye, an early access title on Steam”<br>GamingBible<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358630/b2a4c62e183cf33c239e47a748ceee6badba1ba3/header.jpg?t=1787693693", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358630/1fceb78ca9d835f56a62a366279982f53e31a355/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787693693", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358630/1fceb78ca9d835f56a62a366279982f53e31a355/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787693693", "website": "https://nixalonstudios.wixsite.com/nixalon", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i7-7700K / AMD Ryzen 5 1600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 580 8GB / Intel Arc A750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 60 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD (Preferred), Internet Connection Required for Multiplayer (Excluding LAN), Low Quality Setting. The above specifications were tested with DLSS/FSR/XeSS enabled.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-11700 / AMD Ryzen 7 5800X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 3070 Ti / Nvidia GeForce RTX 4070 / AMD Radeon RX 6800 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 60 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sou